{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Ajina","html":"<article id='thag2.5'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 2.5 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 2.5 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Dukanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Twos </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Paṭhamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter One </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Ajinattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Ajina </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Api ce hoti tevijjo, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Even a master of the three knowledges, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>maccuhāyī anāsavo; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>undefiled, conqueror of death, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Appaññātoti naṁ bālā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>is looked down upon for being unknown </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>avajānanti ajānatā. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>by ignorant fools. </span></span></p>\n<p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Yo ca kho annapānassa, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>But any individual here </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>lābhī hotidha puggalo; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>who gets food and drink </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Pāpadhammopi ce hoti, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>is honored by them, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>so nesaṁ hoti sakkato”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>even if they are of bad character. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Ajino thero …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
